Project: LAN Party Landing Page
Build a single-page website for a LAN party event. Frontend only for now — backend integration will come later.
Design

Dark theme throughout
Page content sits with 20px padding from the viewport edge, allowing shadows/depth around the main container
Background image is admin-configurable
Centered countdown timer as the main visual focus

Auth

Hardcoded login for now: { user: "admin", password: "123" }
No public registration — just an admin login

Admin Capabilities (visible only when logged in)

Slide-out settings sidebar containing all editable options
Change the LAN party name
Change the countdown target date
Change the background image

Tech Stack

TypeScript
Vite
Tailwind CSS
Zustand (state management)
Zod (validation)
TanStack Query
React Hook Form (useForm)

